From d430ca8399fbe8c6ced7ed2c58c711d159477205 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jason Perlow <jperlow@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 01:38:06 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 04/17] fix(wallpaper): enforce gallery source boundaries

Admit recent images only when the selected collection scan contains them. Exclude separately registered nested packs while retaining provider subdirectories. Exercise the production scanner with mixed history and a live-state probe.

(cherry picked from commit bd9dd7a8de0ce3ef1da7dcf638b1f60f5f003f14)
